; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - gold trend sleeve (entry mode 8, chapter 93). No specific days and no time-of-day habits are used for decisions.
; For a commodity CFD account (OANDA: a separate sub-account from FX and from indices).
; Trend (long only): hold gold while the close is above the 200-day average, reviewed every 7 days.
; Sizing: the position's own volatility is 11.2% of equity per year (trend sleeve about 10% per year).
; The chapter-98 additions (HAR-type volatility forecast, VIX multiplier, daily stop) were validated for the index reversion sleeve only,
; so this preset keeps the validated form: 60-day volatility, no VIX multiplier, no stop.
; Attach to an XAUUSD chart (H1).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=none
InpIxTrendSymbols=XAUUSD
InpIxRuleR2=false
InpIxRuleD7=false
InpIxRuleIBS=false
InpIxRevUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendUnitVol=11.2
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=3.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=0.0
InpIxVolModel=0
InpIxVixFile=none
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=80.0
